OL,3,ACriminals detained in hospital set to
OL,4,Alose benefits
OL,5,
OL,6,FEmma Webber, the mother of Barnaby
OL,7,FWebber, who was killed by Valdo
OL,8,FCalocane in Nottingham and sentenced to
OL,9,Fa hospital order, said she would now
OL,10,F"demand" ministers reallocate the
OL,11,Ffunds, which she said was a "no
OL,12,Fbrainer".
OL,14,FThe government said closing the
OL,15,Floophole would save an estimated tens
OL,16,Fof millions of pounds annually.
